.TH SIGMA-PKG 8 "2026-03-31" "SigmaOS 1.0" "SigmaOS System Management Commands"
.SH NAME
sigma-pkg \- Sovereign package manager and reproducible build engine
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sigma-pkg
[\ \fICOMMAND\fR\ ]
[\ \fIOPTIONS\fR\ ]
[\ \fIPACKAGE...\fR\ ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B sigma-pkg
is the primary package management utility and build engine for SigmaOS. Inspired by FreeBSD Ports, Arch pacman, and Nix content-addressable storage, \fBsigma-pkg\fR manages binary \fI.spkg\fR packages, multi-distro format translations (\fI.deb\fR, \fI.rpm\fR, \fI.apk\fR, \fIPKGBUILD\fR), hermetic chroot builds, and PQC signed repository synchronization.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.BR install\ \fIPACKAGE...\fR
Resolve dependencies, verify PQC SHA256/Dilithium-5 signatures, and install packages.
.TP
.BR remove\ \fIPACKAGE...\fR
Safely uninstall specified packages and unneeded orphan dependencies.
.TP
.BR sync
Synchronize repository metadata mirrors over P2P CAS network.
.TP
.BR build\ \fIPKGBUILD|RECIPE\fR
Execute deterministic hermetic chroot package build inside \fBMakepkgSandbox\fR.
.TP
.BR audit\ \fIPACKAGE...\fR
Perform security audit on package recipes for dangerous commands or unverified binaries.
.TP
.BR translate\ \fIFOREIGN_PKG\fR
Translate foreign Linux/BSD packages (\fI.deb\fR, \fI.rpm\fR, \fI.apk\fR, \fIebuild\fR) into native \fI.spkg\fR specifications.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-y ",\ " \-\-noconfirm
Bypass interactive prompts and automatically accept transaction decisions.
.TP
.BR \-\-pqc\-verify
Enforce post-quantum signature verification on all downloaded package payloads.
.TP
.BR \-\-reproducible
Audit build environment and enforce SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH for bit-for-bit determinism.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/sigma-pkg/sigma-pkg.conf
Global configuration file specifying repository mirrors and PQC keys.
.TP
.I /var/lib/sigma-pkg/db/
Package database tracking installed files, hashes, and dependency graphs.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sigma-sh (1),
.BR pkg (8),
.BR pacman (8)
